{"4132460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CATpitalist Cafe Simulator", "steam_appid": 4132460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5059390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Humanoid CATS - build, manage, and expand a growing network of businesses in <strong>CATpitalist Cafe Simulator</strong>, a chaotic 4-player co-op tycoon game where you and your friends work together to rebuild Los Nyangeles, a struggling coastal city while furthering your own CATpitalist ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a cozy café, earn profits, automate operations, and unlock more businesses as your empire grows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/756e8f85e5de893cb4d939c53afd2b17.poster.avif?t=1786990318\" aria-label=\"Serve Customers\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/756e8f85e5de893cb4d939c53afd2b17.webm?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/756e8f85e5de893cb4d939c53afd2b17.mp4?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, manage customers, keep tables clean, and handle the rush during busy hours. Fast service and smart teamwork are the key to keeping your business running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/c3856560174ec9863ba1d51c1a249397.poster.avif?t=1786990318\" aria-label=\"Prepare Meals\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/c3856560174ec9863ba1d51c1a249397.webm?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/c3856560174ec9863ba1d51c1a249397.mp4?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook and assemble meals in a fast-paced kitchen where efficiency matters. Coordinate with friends, restock ingredients and keep up with increasing demand as your café expands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/fee2a9f899e65fea71406961b9650f1f.poster.avif?t=1786990318\" aria-label=\"Work Together\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/fee2a9f899e65fea71406961b9650f1f.webm?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/fee2a9f899e65fea71406961b9650f1f.mp4?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players online. Split responsibilities, manage different tasks, and turn chaotic situations into a profitable operation through teamwork and coordination. (or just be a menace to everyone)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/19d1787e0f637024abecf1d274dab561.poster.avif?t=1786990318\" aria-label=\"Manage your restaurant\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/19d1787e0f637024abecf1d274dab561.webm?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/19d1787e0f637024abecf1d274dab561.mp4?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade equipment, unlock automations, hire staff, and optimize your workflow. Expand your business and transform a small café into a thriving operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/fffedbda1980af986c22298a04a55b94.poster.avif?t=1786990318\" aria-label=\"Expand your Business\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/fffedbda1980af986c22298a04a55b94.webm?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/fffedbda1980af986c22298a04a55b94.mp4?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new businesses including aquariums, zoos, museums, and more. Each business introduces new mechanics, challenges and ways to grow your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/4a98118ef103aae417156ad78e55a1b5.poster.avif?t=1786990318\" aria-label=\"Fish and Explore\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/4a98118ef103aae417156ad78e55a1b5.webm?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/4a98118ef103aae417156ad78e55a1b5.mp4?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from business management and head out fishing to enjoy a cozy, chill evening. OR... continue your CATpitalist tendencies and catch valuable fish to earn even more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town, discover new locations and unlock new opportunities as you progress and become a true CATpitalist!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Humanoid CATS - build, manage, and expand a growing network of businesses in <strong>CATpitalist Cafe Simulator</strong>, a chaotic 4-player co-op tycoon game where you and your friends work together to rebuild Los Nyangeles, a struggling coastal city while furthering your own CATpitalist ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a cozy café, earn profits, automate operations, and unlock more businesses as your empire grows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/756e8f85e5de893cb4d939c53afd2b17.poster.avif?t=1786990318\" aria-label=\"Serve Customers\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/756e8f85e5de893cb4d939c53afd2b17.webm?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132460/extras/756e8f85e5de893cb4d939c53afd2b17.mp4?t=1786990318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, manage customers, keep tables clean, and handle the rush during busy hours. Fast service and smart teamwork are the key to keeping your business running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset